WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.301
I have no romance for any
marketing or business behavior

00:00:04.301 --> 00:00:07.410
and never will 
'til the day I die. Period.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:12.664
And that's a very important 
statement that so few

00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:16.886
in this room actually,
deeply believe.

00:00:16.886 --> 00:00:22.151
And if you did, then you would 
never disrespect anything new

00:00:22.151 --> 00:00:25.742
that has 150 million

00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:29.442
active monthly users 
like Snapchat

00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:32.078
because it doesn't have a 
click out function so you

00:00:32.078 --> 00:00:35.102
can figure out what 
the conversion rate is.

00:00:35.102 --> 00:00:38.608
The reason I am going 
to make billions and

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:40.607
have made hundreds 
of millions and the reason

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:43.592
many in here will make millions
is 'cause there's a difference

00:00:43.592 --> 00:00:48.553
between sales and transactions
and brand and marketing.

00:00:48.553 --> 00:00:51.740
If you just realized it was 
in your best financial interest

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:54.925
to take 20% of your monies
and behaviors and learn

00:00:54.925 --> 00:00:58.527
new things and learn 'em.

00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:00.911
You would make so 
much more success

00:01:00.911 --> 00:01:02.596
out of your businesses.

00:01:02.596 --> 00:01:05.537
(upbeat techno music)

